# Files the STORE owns, not the repo.
#
# `shopify theme push` overwrites the store with local files. These two hold
# merchant configuration rather than code, so pushing them undoes whatever was
# changed in the theme editor — deleted sections reappear, hidden ones come
# back, theme settings revert.
#
# Code moves up (push), configuration moves down (pull / theme dev sync).

# Which sections are on the page, their order, and every section setting.
templates/index.json

# Global theme settings: colour schemes, typography, favicon, social links.
config/settings_data.json

# To deliberately send one of these anyway:
#   shopify theme push --only templates/index.json
